- [ ] Multi-window: detach a terminal tab <!-- id: k15 labels: feature blockedBy: k10 -->
      Needs the PTY hosted outside the window process. The sidecar terminal gateway (remote mode) already does that: make it the default local path, then detaching becomes attaching the same session id in another window. Bonus: terminals survive a UI crash. Decide whether this lands in 2.0 or after.

- [ ] Remove the native Pi agent (pi --mode rpc) from the binary <!-- id: k16 labels: feature -->
      Decided 2026-09-12: the native agent tab is deprecated and leaves in 2.0. Few people use it, the terminal path (claude, codex, pi in a terminal tab with hooks) is the product, and the agent tab never got .env.cockpit, Restart or extension UI requests. Delete the agent tab, the RPC harness (cockpit/data/rpc), the composer, the enableAgent setting and its migration, the pi daemon/cron integration that depends on it, and the i18n keys. Do it LAST, right before the store publications, so nothing else on this board depends on the removal and the binary ships without it. Closes the "Pi extension UI requests are dropped" bug as won't fix.

- [ ] Consolidated 2.0.0 release notes <!-- id: k1 labels: docs blockedBy: k16, k2 -->
      Every 1.x since 1.28.0 is a 2.0 beta. Write the single 2.0.0 section from the 1.x changelog entries; it is what Sparkle and the download page will show.

